{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, לִשָּׁן","hw":"לִשָּׁן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לִשָּׁן</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:7\" href=\"/Daniel.3.7\">Dn 3:7</a></sup> <strong>tongue (</strong>𝔗 Syriac; v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, לָשׁוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_לָשׁוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">לָשׁוֹן</a>, √ <span dir=\"rtl\">לשׁן</span><strong>)</strong>;—<em>tongue</em> = <em>language</em>, fig. for <em>people:</em> abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַם אֻמָּה וְל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:29\" href=\"/Daniel.3.29\">Dn 3:29</a>; pl. emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ א׳ וְלִשָּׁנַיָּא</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:4\" href=\"/Daniel.3.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:7\" href=\"/Daniel.3.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:31\" href=\"/Daniel.3.31\">31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:19\" href=\"/Daniel.5.19\">5:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:26\" href=\"/Daniel.6.26\">6:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:14\" href=\"/Daniel.7.14\">7:14</a> (cf. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, לָשׁוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_לָשׁוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">לָשׁוֹן</a> <strong>2</strong>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.18\">Is 66:18</a>).","next":"BDB Aramaic, מָא","prev":"BDB Aramaic, לֵילָא"}